{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been overrun by GRIMPS.\u00a0Cute, soft and completely insane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a</strong> <strong>GRIMPS</strong> <strong>Fighter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young hero with a gun and a shovel.\u00a0Save Moscow from the disaster and find your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a city full of mysteries, use the GRIMPS themselves as weapons, resources, and tools, steal powers from bosses, and unlock access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, adapt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute, but Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each GRIMP has its own logic and behavior. Study them and turn their features to your advantage! They scream, jump, roll, shove, spit, explode, and cause you endless trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust those adorable button eyes<strong>. </strong>GRIMPS<strong> </strong> have already destroyed half the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.poster.avif?t=1761320194\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.webm?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.mp4?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemy\u2019s Power Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses and claim their abilities. Summon giant GRIMPS  as allies in battle. Freeze, burn, crush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.poster.avif?t=1761320194\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.webm?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.mp4?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRIMP as a Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use enemy powers to break barriers and reach hidden areas on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.poster.avif?t=1761320194\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.webm?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.mp4?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story on the Edge of Trash and Drama</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your sister, uncover the origin of the GRIMPS, and survive the chaos. And if you can't, die gloriously or with a padding polyester<strong> </strong>on your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.poster.avif?t=1761320194\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.webm?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.mp4?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRIMPS  as loot, consumables, and tactical resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental combos: freeze, blow up, clear the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of multi-layered locations filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon defeated bosses to fight by your side</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3297800?t=1761320194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761320194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/b81b675d555f374491ac6b1cbb7e235917841fac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761320194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/b81b675d555f374491ac6b1cbb7e235917841fac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761320194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been overrun by GRIMPS.\u00a0Cute, soft and completely insane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a</strong> <strong>GRIMPS</strong> <strong>Fighter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young hero with a gun and a shovel.\u00a0Save Moscow from the disaster and find your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a city full of mysteries, use the GRIMPS themselves as weapons, resources, and tools, steal powers from bosses, and unlock access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, adapt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute, but Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each GRIMP has its own logic and behavior. Study them and turn their features to your advantage! They scream, jump, roll, shove, spit, explode, and cause you endless trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust those adorable button eyes<strong>. </strong>GRIMPS<strong> </strong> have already destroyed half the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.poster.avif?t=1761320194\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.webm?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.mp4?t=1761320194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemy\u2019s Power Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses and claim their abilities. Summon giant GRIMPS  as allies in battle. Freeze, burn, crush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.poster.avif?t=1761320194\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4fa